  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: CH1-LVL2-SCENE1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Atlas, your initial progress is commendable. Today's focus? Deepening your
      bond with Hyperion. Learn from those who've been through it. Meet Cygnus, the
      top handler of his battalion.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'Pleasure to meet you, Atlas. Luna''s spoken highly of you. Though you
      might have heard this in your training, it bears repeating: the strength of
      your bond directly affects your control over the Titan. Never underestimate
      its importance.'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I understand, Cygnus. Let's begin.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Strengthening your bond with Hyperion is akin to refining your body and
      building relationships. Just as we exercise to improve physically and connect
      with others through group workouts, so too can you sync with Hyperion. By training
      within Hyperion, you both adapt to each other's rhythms and nuances. Let's
      dive in.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 43d488ff33d9bb546b94b13308e41f10, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
